    are "Umbral Horror" monsters: You can Special Summon this card from your hand,
    and if you do, add 1 non-Rock "Umbral Horror" monster from your Deck to your
    hand. Can be treated as 2 materials for the Xyz Summon of a "Number" Xyz Monster
    that requires 3 or more materials.'
